{"id":"e5426143-0928-481b-8dc3-27795fadf23f","name":"PLUTO, MapPLUTO and PLUTO Change File","type":"Public","description":" \n        \n         <div id=\"internal-head\" class=\"internal-header\">\n            <div class=\"column\">\n               <div id=\"breadcrumb\"><a class=\"crumb em--md\" href=\"index_v2.html\">Home </a></div>\n               <div class=\"section-head\">PLUTO, MapPLUTO and PLUTO Change File</div>\n               <div class=\"section-head-description\"></div>\n            </div>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"content-container resource\">\n            <aside>\n               <a class=\"arrow-link\" href=\"#overview\">Overview</a>\n               <a class=\"arrow-link\" href=\"#recent-release\">Most Recent Release</a>\n               <a class=\"arrow-link sub-link\" href=\"#pluto\">PLUTO</a>\n               <a class=\"arrow-link sub-link\" href=\"#mappluto\">MapPLUTO</a>\n               <a class=\"arrow-link sub-link\" href=\"#change\">PLUTO Change File</a>\n               <a class=\"arrow-link\" href=\"#archive\">Archive</a>\n               <a class=\"arrow-link\" href=\"#use-info\">Access & Use Information</a>\n            </aside>\n            <article>\n               <div class=\"main-section\" id=\"overview\">\n                  <p>\n                     There are two types of PLUTO updates: major and minor. Major updates occur quarterly, and all fields are updated. Minor updates\n                     are released monthly between major updates and only include updates to the zoning attributes. Major release 24v1, Minor release\n                     24v1.1.\n                  </p>\n                  <h3>PLUTO</h3>\n                  <p>\n                     PLUTO: Extensive land use and geographic data at the tax lot level in comma–separated values (csv) file format. The PLUTO files\n                     contain more than seventy fields derived from data maintained by city agencies.\n                  </p>\n                  <h3>MapPLUTO</h3>\n                  <p>\n                     MapPLUTO merges PLUTO tax lot data with tax lot features from the Department of Finance&rsquo;s Digital Tax Map (DTM) and is\n                     available as shoreline clipped and water included. It contains extensive land use and geographic data at the tax lot level in\n                     ESRI shapefile and File Geodatabase formats.\n                  </p>\n                  <h3>PLUTO Change File</h3>\n                  <p>\n                     PLUTO Change File: PLUTO is created using the best available data from a number of city agencies. To further improve data quality\n                     and consistency, the Department of City Planning (DCP) applies changes to selected field values. The field DCPEdited is set to\n                     “1” in PLUTO if the record contains any changed values. Those applied changes are listed in the PLUTO Change File.\n                  </p>\n                  <p class=\"em--md\">Dataset: Property Data<br />Update Frequency: Monthly</p>\n               </div>\n               <div class=\"main-section\" id=\"recent-release\">\n                  <h1>Most Recent Release</h1>\n                  <p class=\"copy--lg\">\n                     <span class=\"display--block copy--lg\">Latest Release: 26v2</span>\n                     <span class=\"display--block copy--lg\">Date of Data: August 2026</span>\n                  </p>\n                  <div class=\"sub-section\" id=\"pluto\">\n                     <h3>PLUTO</h3>\n                     <table class=\"orange\">\n                        <tr>\n                           <th>PLUTO (.csv format)</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                           <td class=\"dataset-file-container\">\n                              <a\n                                 href=\"https://s-media.nyc.gov/agencies/dcp/assets/files/pdf/data-tools/bytes/pluto_datadictionary.pdf\"\n                                 target=\"_blank\"\n                                 class=\"dataset-link scroll\"\n                              >\n                                 View Data Dictionary\n                              </a>\n                              <a\n                                 href=\"https://s-media.nyc.gov/agencies/dcp/assets/files/pdf/data-tools/bytes/pluto_readme.pdf\"\n                                 target=\"_blank\"\n                                 class=\"dataset-link scroll\"\n                              >\n                                 View Read Me\n                              </a>\n                              <a\n                                 class=\"card-btn download\"\n                                 href=\"https://s-media.nyc.gov/agencies/dcp/assets/files/zip/data-tools/bytes/pluto/nyc_pluto_26v2_csv.zip\"\n                              >\n                                 Download Files\n                              </a>\n                           </td>\n                        </tr>\n                     </table>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"sub-section\" id=\"mappluto\">\n                     <h3>MapPLUTO</h3>\n                     <table class=\"orange\">\n                        <tr>\n                           <th>MapPLUTO - Shoreline Clipped (fgdb)</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                           <td class=\"dataset-file-container\">\n                              <a\n                                 href=\"https://services5.arcgis.com/GfwWNkhOj9bNBqoJ/arcgis/rest/services/MAPPLUTO/FeatureServer/0\"\n                                 target=\"_blank\"\n                                 class=\"dataset-link scroll\"\n                              >\n                                 View REST\n                              </a>\n\n                              <a\n                                 href=\"https://s-media.nyc.gov/agencies/dcp/assets/files/pdf/data-tools/bytes/meta_mappluto.pdf\"\n                                 target=\"_blank\"\n                                 class=\"dataset-link scroll\"\n                              >\n                                 View MetaData\n                              </a>\n                              <a\n                                 class=\"card-btn download\"\n                                 href=\"https://s-media.nyc.gov/agencies/dcp/assets/files/zip/data-tools/bytes/mappluto/nyc_mappluto_26v2_fgdb.zip\"\n                              >\n                                 Download Files\n                              </a>\n                           </td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                           <th>MapPLUTO - Water Included (fgdb)</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                           <td class=\"dataset-file-container\">\n                              <a\n                                 href=\"https://s-media.nyc.gov/agencies/dcp/assets/files/pdf/data-tools/bytes/meta_mappluto_unclipped.pdf\"\n                                 target=\"_blank\"\n                                 class=\"dataset-link scroll\"\n                              >\n                                 View MetaData\n                              </a>\n                              <a\n                                 class=\"card-btn download\"\n                                 href=\"https://s-media.nyc.gov/agencies/dcp/assets/files/zip/data-tools/bytes/mappluto/nyc_mappluto_26v2_unclipped_fgdb.zip\"\n                              >\n                                 Download Files\n                              </a>\n                           </td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                           <th>MapPLUTO - Shoreline Clipped (shp)</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                           <td class=\"dataset-file-container\">\n                              <a\n                                 class=\"card-btn download\"\n                                 href=\"https://s-media.nyc.gov/agencies/dcp/assets/files/zip/data-tools/bytes/mappluto/nyc_mappluto_26v2_shp.zip\"\n                              >\n                                 Download Files\n                              </a>\n                           </td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                           <th>MapPLUTO - Water Included (shp)</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                           <td class=\"dataset-file-container\">\n                              <a\n                                 class=\"card-btn download\"\n                                 href=\"https://s-media.nyc.gov/agencies/dcp/assets/files/zip/data-tools/bytes/mappluto/nyc_mappluto_26v2_unclipped_shp.zip\"\n                              >\n                                 Download Files\n                              </a>\n                           </td>\n                        </tr>\n                     </table>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"sub-section\" id=\"change\">\n                     <h3>PLUTO Change File</h3>\n                     <table class=\"orange\">\n                        <tr>\n                           <th>PLUTO Change File(.csv format)</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                           <td class=\"dataset-file-container\">\n                              <a\n                                 href=\"https://s-media.nyc.gov/agencies/dcp/assets/files/pdf/data-tools/bytes/plutochangefile_readme.pdf\"\n                                 target=\"_blank\"\n                                 class=\"dataset-link scroll\"\n                              >\n                                 View Read Me\n                              </a>\n                              <a\n                                 class=\"card-btn download\"\n                                 href=\"https://s-media.nyc.gov/agencies/dcp/assets/files/zip/data-tools/bytes/pluto-change-file/PLUTOChangeFile26v2.zip\"\n                              >\n                                 Download Files\n                              </a>\n                           </td>\n                        </tr>\n                     </table>\n                  </div>\n               </div>\n               <div class=\"main-section\" id=\"archive\">\n                  <h1>Previous Releases Archive</h1>\n                  <table\n                     class=\"interactive-table\"\n                     data-json=\"/assets/planning/json/content/resources/dataset-archives/mappluto-pluto-change.json\"\n                  ></table>\n               </div>\n               <div class=\"main-section\" id=\"use-info\">\n                  <h1>Access & Use Information</h1>\n                  <div class=\"information-container\">\n                     <p>\n                        <span class=\"font--bold\">Use limitations:</span>\n                        The BYTES of the BIG APPLE software, data and geographic base map files being provided by the Department of City Planning\n                        (DCP) on DCP's website for informational purposes only. DCP does not warranty the completeness, accuracy, content, or fitness\n                        for any particular purpose or use of BYTES of the BIG APPLE products, nor are any such warranties to be implied or inferred\n                        with respect to BYTES of the BIG APPLE products as furnished on the website. DCP and the City are not liable for any\n                        deficiencies in the completeness, accuracy, content, or fitness for any particular purpose or use of BYTES of the BIG APPLE\n                        products, or applications utilizing BYTES of the BIG APPLE products, provided by any third party.\n                     </p>\n                  </div>\n               </div>\n            </article>\n         </div>\n    \n      ","url":"resources/datasets/mappluto-pluto-change","siteId":"planning","relatedContent":[],"media":[]}